<title>DENMARK: Denmark fines Aeroflot on illegal asylum seekers.</title>
<headline>Denmark fines Aeroflot on illegal asylum seekers.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Danish court has fined the Russian airline Aeroflot 4.7 million crowns ($740,000) for flying illegal asylum seekers into Denmark, a court official told Reuters on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Aeroflot was found to have flown 592 asylum seekers who were not in possession of the necessary papers or proper visas into Denmark over a period of years,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>He said the fines, ordered on Tuesday under Denmark's immigration laws, corresponded to 8,000 crowns per asylum seeker and that the Russian airline had 14 days in which to appeal.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652 ($ = 6.376 Danish Crowns)</p>
